5 words to never say in productivity.

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:12,030
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say more hours, instead say better blocks - because people

3
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:15,830
hours don't scale, focus does.

4
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:22,010
Don't say multitask, instead say batch - batching actually finishes.

5
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:28,740
Don't say hustle, instead say system - hustle burns out, systems compound.

6
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:34,610
Don't say work harder, instead say work smarter - effort isn't the edge.

7
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:40,550
